    PARTY `the Minister` DOES `Sch 1: the Minister appoints a person as the Commissioner` AT 5

-- the person does not appear suitable: the appointment does not discharge the duty, which stands
-- EXPECT: STANDING
#TRACE `Sch 1 para 1(1) the Minister must appoint a person appearing to the Minister to be suitable` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Minister` DOES `Sch 1: the Minister appoints a person as the Commissioner` AT 5

-- the office is vacant and nobody has been appointed: the duty stands
-- EXPECT: STANDING
#TRACE `Sch 1 para 1(1) the Minister must appoint a person appearing to the Minister to be suitable` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    -- no events

-- the office is not vacant: there is nothing to appoint
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Sch 1 para 1(1) the Minister must appoint a person appearing to the Minister to be suitable` FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    -- no events

§§ `1(2): before appointing, the views of the Jersey Appointments Commission`
-- appointment on 15 March 2026: reading A needs the views sought by 14 March, reading B by 15 March
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Sch 1 para 1(2) before appointing a person the Minister must seek the views of the Jersey Appointments Commission` `A` (YMD 2026 3 15) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Minister` DOES `Sch 1: the Minister seeks the views of the Jersey Appointments Commission` AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 14))

-- EXPECT: BREACH BY `the Minister`
#TRACE `Sch 1 para 1(2) before appointing a person the Minister must seek the views of the Jersey Appointments Commission` `A` (YMD 2026 3 15) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Minister` DOES `Sch 1: the Minister seeks the views of the Jersey Appointments Commission` AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 15))

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Sch 1 para 1(2) before appointing a person the Minister must seek the views of the Jersey Appointments Commission` `the favoured interpretation, but F9.14 is read as B` (YMD 2026 3 15) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Minister` DOES `Sch 1: the Minister seeks the views of the Jersey Appointments Commission` AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 15))

-- the views not sought by the day before the appointment: the duty is breached
-- EXPECT: BREACH BY `the Minister`
