    (`WAIT UNTIL` (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 15)))

-- the views not yet sought on the last day for them: still open
-- EXPECT: STANDING
#TRACE `Sch 1 para 1(2) before appointing a person the Minister must seek the views of the Jersey Appointments Commission` `A` (YMD 2026 3 15) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 1)) WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 14)))

`B of F9.14` MEANS `the favoured interpretation, but F9.14 is read as B`
