#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 1(2) the views of the Jersey Appointments Commission were sought before the appointment` `B of F9.14` (`build an appointment` (YMD 2026 3 15) (YMD 2026 3 15) (YMD 2032 3 15) TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 15)) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) FALSE FALSE NOTHING `no earlier service`)
