`a re-appointment of 2032` MEANS `build an appointment` (YMD 2032 3 15) (YMD 2032 3 15) (YMD 2038 3 15) TRUE (JUST (YMD 2032 3 14)) (JUST (YMD 2032 3 1)) TRUE FALSE NOTHING `no earlier service`
