#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 1(3) the notice of intention was presented to the States in time` `B of F9.1` `an appointment of 15 March 2026 with a notice on 1 March`
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 1(3) the notice of intention was presented to the States in time` `A` `an appointment of 15 March 2026 with a notice on 28 February`
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 1(3) the notice of intention was presented to the States in time` `B of F9.1` `an appointment of 15 March 2026 with a notice on 28 February`
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 1(3) the notice of intention was presented to the States in time` `A` `an appointment of 15 March 2026 with a notice on 2 March`
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 1(3) the notice of intention was presented to the States in time` `B of F9.1` `an appointment of 15 March 2026 with a notice on 2 March`
-- no notice has been presented: not in time
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 1(3) the notice of intention was presented to the States in time` `A` `an appointment of 15 March 2026 with no notice`
-- a re-appointment is an appointment (1(6)): a notice 14 days before a re-appointment on 15 March 2032 is in time
