§ `Schedule 1 paragraph 3: termination of office as Commissioner`

GIVEN given IS A DATE
      writing IS A BOOLEAN
      effective IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Notice of resignation of the Commissioner`
`build a notice of resignation` given writing effective MEANS
    `Notice of resignation of the Commissioner` OF given, writing, effective

GIVEN firstDay IS A MAYBE DATE
      lastDay IS A MAYBE DATE
      absent IS A BOOLEAN
      bankrupt IS A BOOLEAN
      ill IS A BOOLEAN
      unfit IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Grounds for terminating the appointment of the Commissioner`
`build grounds` firstDay lastDay absent bankrupt ill unfit MEANS
    `Grounds for terminating the appointment of the Commissioner` OF firstDay, lastDay, absent, bankrupt, ill, unfit

