`a notice given on 30 November 2026 to take effect on 2 March 2027` MEANS `build a notice of resignation` (YMD 2026 11 30) TRUE (YMD 2027 3 2)
`a notice given on 30 November 2026 to take effect on 27 February 2027` MEANS `build a notice of resignation` (YMD 2026 11 30) TRUE (YMD 2027 2 27)
`an oral notice given on 30 November 2026 to take effect on 28 February 2027` MEANS `build a notice of resignation` (YMD 2026 11 30) FALSE (YMD 2027 2 28)
