#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(1)(a) the day the office ends by resignation` `C of F9.3` `a notice given on 30 November 2026 to take effect on 2 March 2027` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2027 3 2)
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(1)(a) the day the office ends by resignation` `A` `a notice given on 30 November 2026 to take effect on 27 February 2027` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(1)(a) the day the office ends by resignation` `B of F9.3` `a notice given on 30 November 2026 to take effect on 27 February 2027` EQUALS NOTHING
