§§ `3(4): the appointment expires`
-- a 6 year appointment from 1 March 2026 to 1 March 2032, with no earlier service, not followed by a re-appointment, the person never a member of the States
`a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` MEANS `build an appointment` (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2032 3 1) TRUE NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE NOTHING `no earlier service`
-- the same appointment, followed by a re-appointment when its period expires
`a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01 followed by a re-appointment` MEANS `build an appointment` (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2032 3 1) TRUE NOTHING NOTHING FALSE TRUE NOTHING `no earlier service`
-- trap T21: ten years served, then a re-appointment from 1 March 2036 for 5 years (to 1 March 2041): the 12 years are complete on 1 March 2038, two years into the new period
`the re-appointment of 2036 for 5 years` MEANS `build an appointment` (YMD 2036 3 1) (YMD 2036 3 1) (YMD 2041 3 1) TRUE NOTHING NOTHING TRUE FALSE NOTHING `ten years of service`
-- the person became a member of the States on 15 June 2030, during the appointment
`a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01, member of the States from 2030-06-15` MEANS `build an appointment` (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2032 3 1) TRUE NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE (JUST (YMD 2030 6 15)) `no earlier service`
-- the person was already a member of the States on 1 January 2025, before the appointment
`a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01, member of the States since 2025-01-01` MEANS `build an appointment` (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2032 3 1) TRUE NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE (JUST (YMD 2025 1 1)) `no earlier service`
-- 14 months as a designated relevant person, then an appointment from 1 June 2027 for 6 years
`a 6 year appointment from 2027-06-01 after service as a designated person` MEANS `build an appointment` (YMD 2027 6 1) (YMD 2027 6 1) (YMD 2033 6 1) TRUE NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE NOTHING `a spell as a designated person`
`B of F9.6` MEANS `the favoured interpretation, but F9.6 is read as B`
`B of F9.11` MEANS `the favoured interpretation, but F9.11 is read as B`
`B of F9.17` MEANS `the favoured interpretation, but F9.17 is read as B`
-- (a): the period expires on its end date, unless a re-appointment follows
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4)(a) the day the period of the appointment expires without re-appointment` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2032 3 1)
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4)(a) the day the period of the appointment expires without re-appointment` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01 followed by a re-appointment` EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b): becoming a member of the States
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4)(b) the day the person becomes a member of the States` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4)(b) the day the person becomes a member of the States` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01, member of the States from 2030-06-15` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2030 6 15)
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4)(b) the day the person becomes a member of the States` `B of F9.17` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01, member of the States from 2030-06-15` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2030 6 15)
-- F9.17: a person already a member when appointed: reading A (only becoming a member ends the appointment) finds no such day; reading B ends the appointment on its first day
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4)(b) the day the person becomes a member of the States` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01, member of the States since 2025-01-01` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4)(b) the day the person becomes a member of the States` `B of F9.17` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01, member of the States since 2025-01-01` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)
-- (c): 12 years of service
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4)(c) the day the person completes 12 years of service as the Commissioner` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` EQUALS YMD 2038 3 1
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4)(c) the day the person completes 12 years of service as the Commissioner` `B of F9.6` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` EQUALS YMD 2038 2 26
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4)(c) the day the person completes 12 years of service as the Commissioner` `A` `the re-appointment of 2036 for 5 years` EQUALS YMD 2038 3 1
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4)(c) the day the person completes 12 years of service as the Commissioner` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2027-06-01 after service as a designated person` EQUALS YMD 2039 6 1
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4)(c) the day the person completes 12 years of service as the Commissioner` `B of F9.11` `a 6 year appointment from 2027-06-01 after service as a designated person` EQUALS YMD 2038 4 1
-- the first day on which the appointment has expired: the earliest of (a), (b) and (c)
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the day on which the appointment expires` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` EQUALS YMD 2032 3 1
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the appointment has expired by the day` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` (YMD 2032 2 29)
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the appointment has expired by the day` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` (YMD 2032 3 1)
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the appointment has expired by the day` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` (YMD 2032 3 2)
-- followed by a re-appointment: the period's end is not an expiry; the 12 year mark is
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the day on which the appointment expires` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01 followed by a re-appointment` EQUALS YMD 2038 3 1
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the appointment has expired by the day` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01 followed by a re-appointment` (YMD 2032 3 1)
-- trap T21: the 5 year period would run to 1 March 2041 but the appointment expires on 1 March 2038 (reading A) or 26 February 2038 (reading B)
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the day on which the appointment expires` `A` `the re-appointment of 2036 for 5 years` EQUALS YMD 2038 3 1
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the day on which the appointment expires` `B of F9.6` `the re-appointment of 2036 for 5 years` EQUALS YMD 2038 2 26
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the appointment has expired by the day` `A` `the re-appointment of 2036 for 5 years` (YMD 2038 2 28)
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the appointment has expired by the day` `A` `the re-appointment of 2036 for 5 years` (YMD 2038 3 1)
-- the States: the appointment expires on the day the person becomes a member
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the day on which the appointment expires` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01, member of the States from 2030-06-15` EQUALS YMD 2030 6 15
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the appointment has expired by the day` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01, member of the States from 2030-06-15` (YMD 2030 6 14)
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the appointment has expired by the day` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01, member of the States from 2030-06-15` (YMD 2030 6 15)
-- F9.17: already a member: no expiry from that on reading A; on reading B the appointment expires on its first day
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the day on which the appointment expires` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01, member of the States since 2025-01-01` EQUALS YMD 2032 3 1
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the day on which the appointment expires` `B of F9.17` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01, member of the States since 2025-01-01` EQUALS YMD 2026 3 1
-- F9.11 does not change when the term itself ends: the period of 6 years ends first on either reading
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the day on which the appointment expires` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2027-06-01 after service as a designated person` EQUALS YMD 2033 6 1
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(4) the day on which the appointment expires` `B of F9.11` `a 6 year appointment from 2027-06-01 after service as a designated person` EQUALS YMD 2033 6 1

§§ `3(1): a person ceases to be appointed as the Commissioner`
`no resignation and no termination` MEANS `Events that may end the office of the Commissioner` OF NOTHING, NOTHING
`a valid resignation taking effect on 28 February 2027` MEANS `Events that may end the office of the Commissioner` OF (JUST `a notice given on 30 November 2026 to take effect on 28 February 2027`), NOTHING
`a resignation on short notice` MEANS `Events that may end the office of the Commissioner` OF (JUST `a notice given on 30 November 2026 to take effect on 27 February 2027`), NOTHING
`a termination for bankruptcy taking effect on 1 January 2028` MEANS `Events that may end the office of the Commissioner` OF NOTHING, (JUST (`Termination of the appointment of the Commissioner` OF (YMD 2028 1 1), `bankrupt, the Minister satisfied`))
`a termination with no ground taking effect on 1 January 2028` MEANS `Events that may end the office of the Commissioner` OF NOTHING, (JUST (`Termination of the appointment of the Commissioner` OF (YMD 2028 1 1), `no ground at all`))
-- by resignation (b): on 28 February 2027, not the day before
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 3(1) the person has ceased to be appointed as the Commissioner by the day` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` `a valid resignation taking effect on 28 February 2027` (YMD 2027 2 27)
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(1) the person has ceased to be appointed as the Commissioner by the day` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` `a valid resignation taking effect on 28 February 2027` (YMD 2027 2 28)
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(1)(a) the person has resigned by the day` `A` `a valid resignation taking effect on 28 February 2027` (YMD 2027 3 1)
-- a resignation on short notice is no resignation: the person has not ceased
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 3(1) the person has ceased to be appointed as the Commissioner by the day` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` `a resignation on short notice` (YMD 2027 3 1)
-- reading B of F9.3: the office ended on the day the notice was given
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(1) the person has ceased to be appointed as the Commissioner by the day` `B of F9.3` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` `a valid resignation taking effect on 28 February 2027` (YMD 2026 11 30)
-- by termination under 3(2): from 1 January 2028 when the Minister was satisfied of a ground; a termination with no ground is not a termination under 3(2)
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 3(1) the person has ceased to be appointed as the Commissioner by the day` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` `a termination for bankruptcy taking effect on 1 January 2028` (YMD 2027 12 31)
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(1) the person has ceased to be appointed as the Commissioner by the day` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` `a termination for bankruptcy taking effect on 1 January 2028` (YMD 2028 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 3(1) the person has ceased to be appointed as the Commissioner by the day` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` `a termination with no ground taking effect on 1 January 2028` (YMD 2028 1 2)
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 3(1)(b) the Minister has terminated the appointment by the day` `A` `a termination with no ground taking effect on 1 January 2028` (YMD 2028 6 1)
-- by expiry (c): on 1 March 2032, not the day before; with no event the person is in office until then
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 3(1) the person has ceased to be appointed as the Commissioner by the day` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` `no resignation and no termination` (YMD 2032 2 29)
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 3(1) the person has ceased to be appointed as the Commissioner by the day` `A` `a 6 year appointment from 2026-03-01` `no resignation and no termination` (YMD 2032 3 1)

