#ASSERT NOT `reserved from staff` `A` (`Decision of the Commissioner` OF `whether to impose a requirement contained in a required steps notice`, `the Commissioner refuses`)
#ASSERT NOT `reserved from staff` `A` (`Decision of the Commissioner` OF `any other matter`, `the Commissioner does what was sought or proposed`)
#ASSERT NOT `reserved from staff` `A` (`Decision of the Commissioner` OF `any other matter`, `the Commissioner refuses`)

-- F9.8 reading B: only the refusal under Article 15(3) is reserved
#ASSERT `reserved from staff` `B of F9.8` (`Decision of the Commissioner` OF `whether to deregister a charity on its own application, Article 15(3)`, `the Commissioner refuses`)
#ASSERT NOT `reserved from staff` `B of F9.8` (`Decision of the Commissioner` OF `whether to deregister a charity on its own application, Article 15(3)`, `the Commissioner does what was sought or proposed`)
-- the other two reserved decisions are reserved on either outcome under B of F9.8 too
#ASSERT `reserved from staff` `B of F9.8` (`Decision of the Commissioner` OF `whether to register an applicant, Article 11`, `the Commissioner does what was sought or proposed`)
#ASSERT `reserved from staff` `B of F9.8` (`Decision of the Commissioner` OF `whether to deregister a charity in other cases, Article 16`, `the Commissioner does what was sought or proposed`)
-- F9.16 reading B: the decision on entry in the restricted section is reserved as part of the decision whether to register
#ASSERT `reserved from staff` `B of F9.16` (`Decision of the Commissioner` OF `whether to enter a charity in the restricted section, Article 9(6) and (7)`, `the Commissioner does what was sought or proposed`)
#ASSERT `reserved from staff` `B of F9.16` (`Decision of the Commissioner` OF `whether to enter a charity in the restricted section, Article 9(6) and (7)`, `the Commissioner refuses`)

-- the discriminating case of T17 and F9.8: a member of staff deregisters an entity on its own application, with the Commissioner's authorization
`staff deregister an entity on its own application` MEANS `Decision of the Commissioner` OF `whether to deregister a charity on its own application, Article 15(3)`, `the Commissioner does what was sought or proposed`
`staff refuse to deregister an entity on its own application` MEANS `Decision of the Commissioner` OF `whether to deregister a charity on its own application, Article 15(3)`, `the Commissioner refuses`
`staff register an applicant` MEANS `Decision of the Commissioner` OF `whether to register an applicant, Article 11`, `the Commissioner does what was sought or proposed`
`staff deregister a charity under Article 16` MEANS `Decision of the Commissioner` OF `whether to deregister a charity in other cases, Article 16`, `the Commissioner does what was sought or proposed`
`staff permit a name change` MEANS `Decision of the Commissioner` OF `whether to permit a change or addition of registered name, Article 12(4)`, `the Commissioner does what was sought or proposed`
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 4(3) a member of the Commissioner's staff may exercise the function on behalf of the Commissioner` `A` `staff deregister an entity on its own application` TRUE
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 4(3) a member of the Commissioner's staff may exercise the function on behalf of the Commissioner` `B of F9.8` `staff deregister an entity on its own application` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 4(3) a member of the Commissioner's staff may exercise the function on behalf of the Commissioner` `B of F9.8` `staff refuse to deregister an entity on its own application` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 4(3) a member of the Commissioner's staff may exercise the function on behalf of the Commissioner` `A` `staff register an applicant` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 4(3) a member of the Commissioner's staff may exercise the function on behalf of the Commissioner` `A` `staff deregister a charity under Article 16` TRUE
-- another function, authorized: staff may exercise it; not authorized: they may not, to the extent the Commissioner has not authorized it
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 4(3) a member of the Commissioner's staff may exercise the function on behalf of the Commissioner` `A` `staff permit a name change` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 4(3) a member of the Commissioner's staff may exercise the function on behalf of the Commissioner` `A` `staff permit a name change` FALSE
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 4(3) a member of the Commissioner's staff may exercise the function on behalf of the Commissioner` `A` (`Decision of the Commissioner` OF `any other matter`, `the Commissioner does what was sought or proposed`) TRUE
-- the three decisions the paragraph names, one by one (4(3)(a), (b), (c))
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 4(3)(a) the decision is the decision under Article 11 on whether to register a charity` `staff register an applicant`
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 4(3)(a) the decision is the decision under Article 11 on whether to register a charity` `staff deregister a charity under Article 16`
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 4(3)(b) the decision is the decision under Article 15(3) on whether to refuse to deregister a charity` `staff deregister an entity on its own application`
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 4(3)(b) the decision is the decision under Article 15(3) on whether to refuse to deregister a charity` `staff refuse to deregister an entity on its own application`
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 4(3)(b) the decision is the decision under Article 15(3) on whether to refuse to deregister a charity` `staff register an applicant`
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 4(3)(c) the decision is the decision under Article 16 on whether to deregister a charity` `staff deregister a charity under Article 16`
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 4(3)(c) the decision is the decision under Article 16 on whether to deregister a charity` `staff register an applicant`

