§§ `4(8): a report on the activities in each calendar year`
`F9.12 reading B` MEANS `the favoured interpretation, but F9.12 is read as B`
GIVEN year IS A NUMBER
      prepared IS A BOOLEAN
      published IS A BOOLEAN
      provided IS A MAYBE DATE
      soonest IS A BOOLEAN
      laid IS A MAYBE DATE
      laidSoon IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Report of the Commissioner on a calendar year`
`build a report` year prepared published provided soonest laid laidSoon MEANS
    `Report of the Commissioner on a calendar year` OF year, prepared, published, provided, soonest, laid, laidSoon
