§§ `4(9): the report to the Minister, as soon as practicable and in no case later than 4 months after the end of the year`
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 4(9) the report must be provided in no case later than this many months after the end of the year` EQUALS 4
`B of F9.7` MEANS `the favoured interpretation, but F9.7 is read as B`
`B of F9.10, 28 days` MEANS `the favoured interpretation, but F9.10 is read as B with 28 days`
-- the last day: 30 April 2027 (31 December 2026 plus 4 months, clamped); 1 May on reading B of F9.7; with 28 days from the end of the year, 28 January 2027
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 4(9) the last day for providing the Minister with the report` `A` 2026 EQUALS YMD 2027 4 30
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 4(9) the last day for providing the Minister with the report` `B of F9.7` 2026 EQUALS YMD 2027 5 1
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 4(9) the last day for providing the Minister with the report` `B of F9.10, 28 days` 2026 EQUALS YMD 2027 1 28
-- provided in time: on the last day yes, the day after no (30 April and 1 May 2027), the judgement being that it was as soon as practicable
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 4(9) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the report in time` `A` (`build a report` 2026 TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2027 4 30)) TRUE NOTHING FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 4(9) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the report in time` `A` (`build a report` 2026 TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2027 5 1)) TRUE NOTHING FALSE)
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 4(9) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the report in time` `B of F9.7` (`build a report` 2026 TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2027 5 1)) TRUE NOTHING FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 4(9) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the report in time` `B of F9.7` (`build a report` 2026 TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2027 5 2)) TRUE NOTHING FALSE)
-- not provided at all, or provided in time but not as soon as practicable (the judgement)
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 4(9) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the report in time` `A` (`build a report` 2026 TRUE TRUE NOTHING TRUE NOTHING FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 4(9) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the report in time` `A` (`build a report` 2026 TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2027 4 30)) FALSE NOTHING FALSE)
-- reading B of F9.10: 28 days from the end of the year: 28 January 2027 is in time (the judgement is ignored), 29 January is not
#ASSERT `Sch 1 para 4(9) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the report in time` `B of F9.10, 28 days` (`build a report` 2026 TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2027 1 28)) FALSE NOTHING FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 1 para 4(9) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the report in time` `B of F9.10, 28 days` (`build a report` 2026 TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2027 1 29)) TRUE NOTHING FALSE)
-- the regulative rule, year 2026
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Sch 1 para 4(9) the Commissioner must provide the Minister with the report as soon as practicable after the end of the year, and in no case later than 4 months after it` `A` 2026 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 12 31)) WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `Sch 1: the Commissioner provides the Minister with the report` AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2027 4 30))

-- EXPECT: BREACH BY `the Commissioner`
#TRACE `Sch 1 para 4(9) the Commissioner must provide the Minister with the report as soon as practicable after the end of the year, and in no case later than 4 months after it` `A` 2026 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 12 31)) WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `Sch 1: the Commissioner provides the Minister with the report` AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2027 5 1))

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Sch 1 para 4(9) the Commissioner must provide the Minister with the report as soon as practicable after the end of the year, and in no case later than 4 months after it` `B of F9.7` 2026 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 12 31)) WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `Sch 1: the Commissioner provides the Minister with the report` AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2027 5 1))

-- EXPECT: BREACH BY `the Commissioner`
#TRACE `Sch 1 para 4(9) the Commissioner must provide the Minister with the report as soon as practicable after the end of the year, and in no case later than 4 months after it` `A` 2026 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 12 31)) WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2027 5 1)))

-- EXPECT: STANDING
#TRACE `Sch 1 para 4(9) the Commissioner must provide the Minister with the report as soon as practicable after the end of the year, and in no case later than 4 months after it` `A` 2026 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 12 31)) WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2027 4 30)))

-- EXPECT: BREACH BY `the Commissioner`
#TRACE `Sch 1 para 4(9) the Commissioner must provide the Minister with the report as soon as practicable after the end of the year, and in no case later than 4 months after it` `B of F9.10, 28 days` 2026 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 12 31)) WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `Sch 1: the Commissioner provides the Minister with the report` AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2027 1 29))

§§ `4(10): the Minister lays a copy before the States as soon as practicable after receiving the report`
-- report received on 1 February 2027. Reading A: no day is fixed, the duty stands until it is done. Reading B with 28 days: by 1 March 2027.
