§ `The readings of F9.8, F9.9 and F9.16 called directly`
-- F9.8: the decision under Article 15(3): reading A reserves both outcomes; reading B only the refusal
#ASSERT `F9.8 reading A: both outcomes of the decision under Article 15(3) are reserved` `the Commissioner does what was sought or proposed`
#ASSERT `F9.8 reading A: both outcomes of the decision under Article 15(3) are reserved` `the Commissioner refuses`
#ASSERT `F9.8 reading B: only the refusal under Article 15(3) is reserved` `the Commissioner refuses`
#ASSERT NOT `F9.8 reading B: only the refusal under Article 15(3) is reserved` `the Commissioner does what was sought or proposed`
-- F9.16: the decision on entry in the restricted section
#ASSERT NOT `F9.16 reading A: the decision on entry in the restricted section is not reserved`
#ASSERT `F9.16 reading B: the decision on entry in the restricted section is reserved`
-- F9.9: where an Order under Article 20(1) of the Dormant Bank Accounts (Jersey) Law 2017 directs the cost to the Fund
#ASSERT NOT `F9.9 reading A: the Fund bears the cost the Order directs to it` TRUE
#ASSERT `F9.9 reading A: the Fund bears the cost the Order directs to it` FALSE
#ASSERT `F9.9 reading B: the States remain liable and the Fund only reimburses` TRUE
#ASSERT `F9.9 reading B: the States remain liable and the Fund only reimburses` FALSE
